course: dictionary
lesson: 7999
title: Redesign and the prefix re-
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word redesign is made of two parts: re- and design. Re- means again, so to redesign something is to design it again. «Perseverance's plan to bring the rock samples back to Earth has been delayed and redesigned because of cost.» The plan was made once, then changed so it could be tried again in a better way.
explain: You can often work out a new word by looking at its parts. Design is a word you already know: a plan for how something looks and works. Put re- in front and you get redesign. Check your meaning in the sentence: the plan was made again with changes, so the sentence still makes sense.
explain: Redesign can also be a noun. «A redesign» is the new design itself, or the act of changing it. In «Japan's bullet train nose was redesigned to copy a kingfisher's bill», redesigned is a verb showing the action: engineers changed the nose. The noun names the result of that work.
fact: Redesign means to design something again, changing its look, shape or the way it works.
fact: The prefix re- means again, as in rebuild, rewrite and redo.
fact: A redesign is the new design, or the act of changing it.
fact: Redesigned is the past form of the verb; the other forms are redesign, redesigns and redesigning.
fact: Designers test a model, find problems and redesign it: test, improve, test again.
exercise: «The bullet train nose was redesigned to be quieter in tunnels.» What does redesigned mean? | Painted a new colour | *Designed again, with changes to make it better | Broken and thrown away | Moved to a different city
exercise: Ben says redo means the same kind of thing as redesign. What does the prefix re- tell you? | It means very big | It means under | *It means again | It means not at all
exercise: «The team made a redesign of the coin.» What kind of word is redesign here? | An adjective, describing the coin | A prefix, added to the front of a word | *A noun, naming the new design | A verb, an action word for changing
test: «Perseverance's plan was delayed and redesigned because of cost.» What does redesigned mean here? | *The plan was changed and designed again | The plan was finished early | The plan was kept exactly the same | The plan was thrown into the sea
test: Engineers test a model, find problems and ____ it, then test again. Which word completes the sentence? | forget | *redesign | paint | bury
exam: Which sentence uses redesigned correctly? | Redesigned the sky is blue. | *The team redesigned the model after it failed its test. | The model redesigned the team on Monday. | The kingfisher redesigned its lunch.
